# Desktop check of the real clipboard and the close guard: `haxe tests/clipboard-app/build.hxml`
# from the repo root; exits 0. It leaves "haxeui-cs clipboard-app <n>" on the clipboard, printed on
# its last line, which must still be there after it exits (`Get-Clipboard` on Windows).
-cp tests/clipboard-app
-main Main
-lib haxeui-core
-lib haxeui-cs
-D haxeui_cs_run
-cs tests/clipboard-app/bin
-w -WAll
